	{
		"title": "Cung Thu Dai Chien Event",
		"slug": "cung-thu-dai-chien-event",
		"description": "Event poster & logo design.",
		"image": "/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/thumbnail_eEC9a8i27y.webp",
		"content": "<p><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/02oEv3pFXuYf_PpkXeuLGlg.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><strong>Cung Thu Dai Chien (Archery Battle)</strong> is an event to introduce and directly experience an augmented reality archery game.</p>\r\n<p>The game is divided into 3 main phases:<br><strong>1. Recognition<br></strong>This is the preparation phase before entering the game. Players are recognized by the system and equipped with necessary weapons to fight against monsters.<br><strong>2. Confrontation<br></strong>This is the main phase of the game. Players have the task of facing the challenges posed by the game, defeating monsters that appear and attack the player.<br><strong>3. Conquest<br></strong>This is the final stage when the player has successfully overcome difficulties and obstacles. This is when the player successfully conquers the game and wins.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Purpose of the event</strong><br>- Promote the game<br>- Create a healthy and unique entertainment space for the youth<br>- Create opportunities to exercise, spread positive energy</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/01VI4j5Mrsxh_iirUrdB7NO.webp\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">The event logo combines the event name with the image of a bow. The style evokes the technological nature of the game.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/03pNSDMQEULw_1S64yKC5GS.webp\"></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/04mFSYR6wabL_sztFVV4Z5L.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/05CVv3GTBQRN_7OZCNbhSj6.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9801%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9801%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/06QBdG5HzbLo_eCzJyrfxjB.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/07UpC9DwaQ4a_LF55DiTcRt.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9801%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9801%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/08FN7QkMQBl0_rqwoEpJ44O.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/0947yDjEWS2a_UsNNqoa4UU.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/cung-thu-dai-chien-event/10IxBvixzhvL_Ks7YO1UjaX.webp\"></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px; height: 19.5938px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px; height: 19.5938px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px; height: 19.5938px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
