		"content": "<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/01pyWmKl7ZxV_gSu6WSyG01.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><strong>Steps</strong>&nbsp;is a conceptual magazine I created for my editorial design project at school. It focuses on the cultures of European countries, including their customs, history, cuisine, literature, and more. For this issue, I specifically chose to highlight Britain.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/02vCTvqahlpE_ZlY8KHeeEs.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/03geRMmjtu2k_vxHywSakHb.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/04B1x9QiXyeK_En8xkwYHS6.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/05Za38rH5mLq_Kh8PfgHXC6.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/06uJW9TirkVQ_YAwL9bagk7.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/07w6Qai48roK_vJtDzkMp11.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/08r0eTIhCVet_YROdhH84sU.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/09FOskwBawdI_O9BXluJrTI.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/10qsUFLmaSWg_a11qiUoaPX.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/steps-magazine/11nQg9tTTDou_Mz6MlpZ2ho.webp\"></p>",
